Open Hermes with a model

Usage: wally hermes [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to the tool

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your account

Examples:
  wally hermes -m qwen3-0.6b                    A model on this machine
  wally hermes -m glm-5.3-flash                 A hosted model (needs `wally account login`)
